{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/yacht-bay-select-group-dubai-marina","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":260,"crm_id":"2634","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Yacht Bay","slug":"yacht-bay-select-group-dubai-marina","display_address":"Dubai Marina","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Select Group","price":980000,"display_price":"980K","lattitude":25.0713434,"longitude":55.1343785,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Yacht Bay is a 16-storey tower located within the popular waterfront neighbourhood of Dubai Marina. The developer of the project is Select Group. The apartments offer panoramic views of the marina, surrounding cityscapes and the bay. The facades are made in warm sandy colours, the projecting symmetrical balconies and glazing give the building an elegant and dynamic look.</p><p>Yacht Bay offers 175 flats, including compact <strong>studios and</strong> <strong>1-3 bedroom flats.</strong> The living spaces are furnished with furniture.</p><p>The tower features a fully equipped gym, large temperature-controlled swimming pool, children's pool, Jacuzzi, sauna and steam rooms, barbecue facilities, as well as 24-hour security, secure underground parking and direct access to Marina Walk.</p><p>Yacht Bay residential complex is located 600m from the shopping centre of the same name, surrounded by the developed infrastructure that is usual for central areas. Within walking distance there are commercial and social organisations: schools and clinics, restaurants and eateries, shopping centres and services. Sheikh Zayed Road, one of the largest streets in the city, is nearby. On it car owners can get to any point of the coast, get to the centre or suburbs. The Burj Khalifa Tower is 24 km away and Al Maktoum International Airport is 33 km away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/4WVq1DgA08lzFtx2tnP0CPjcGnIYbvt5YL5pNAcI.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/4WVq1DgA08lzFtx2tnP0CPjcGnIYbvt5YL5pNAcI.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/pRRjNtB7bLo4OD9KXRgIs9z3xL29a6C5TEaCWpiy.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/pRRjNtB7bLo4OD9KXRgIs9z3xL29a6C5TEaCWpiy.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/SBayNv6ghlwVqJ5LVgM7aTzpolfeESb41udO55AZ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/SBayNv6ghlwVqJ5LVgM7aTzpolfeESb41udO55AZ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/y1GN9oYrXPAVSGjUn00bhAFaTExGnTI4pP7xsjKP.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/y1GN9oYrXPAVSGjUn00bhAFaTExGnTI4pP7xsjKP.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/rqgMBxJK9t4sPqA2bProjgRyaJUntuIq2CzG0Vqi.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/rqgMBxJK9t4sPqA2bProjgRyaJUntuIq2CzG0Vqi.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/avKC0wUJP9DeKyxw55ck3TFFFfsKJ6yj3dkXsIqa.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/avKC0wUJP9DeKyxw55ck3TFFFfsKJ6yj3dkXsIqa.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2634/images/2024/07/28/JFF6pqjl39uyheNid7MztQjWHZzUu9Uv4H8bPX1v.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/28/JFF6pqjl39uyheNid7MztQjWHZzUu9Uv4H8bPX1v.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2462,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1694,"thu